{"imdb_tconst": "tt9916190", "imdb_user": "cathyblakeway", "imdb_user_review_topic": "Original and refreshing (with nice Japanese boys)\\n", "imdb_user_review": "When my son asked me what I wanted to watch tonight I told him I wanted to see something different that wasn't your normal action packed mind blowing film. I told him I couldn't handle any more head spinning films that made me dizzy from all the choppy camera work. So he came across this film on Amazon Prime and said it looked different. After a big opening I was pleased to see the story focus on family and protecting each other, no matter what. This was what I wanted to watch with my son. Something with a soul to it. Doesn't need to be the greatest film in the world, but to me it was perfect for a Saturday night piece of entertainment. Few too many naughty words for me but thoroughly enjoyed it! Those Japanese boys are definitely quite the lookers...", "imdb_user_review_date": "17 November 2020", "imdb_user_rating": 8, "imdb_n_helpful_vote": 2, "imdb_t_vote": 3, "url": "https://www.imdb.com/title/tt9916190/reviews", "spider": "imdb_user_review", "date": "20/08/2021"}
