{"imdb_tconst": "tt9916190", "imdb_user": "billygrahamden", "imdb_user_review_topic": "For the budget, no complaints here.\\n", "imdb_user_review": "If they made this for minimal budget, then my first thought is wtf do they do with the millions they spend on some other films. This is a great example of what you can do with an incredibly small budget.Sure the special effects aren't award winning, but if you watch low budget cinema for the special effects, you probably have made some questionable decisions in your life time.The plot was easy to follow, the dialogue funny and the premise entertaining. A really fun film that entertains throughout.", "imdb_user_review_date": "19 December 2020", "imdb_user_rating": 8, "imdb_n_helpful_vote": 0, "imdb_t_vote": 0, "url": "https://www.imdb.com/title/tt9916190/reviews", "spider": "imdb_user_review", "date": "20/08/2021"}
