{"imdb_tconst": "tt9916190", "imdb_user": "garycutt", "imdb_user_review_topic": "Good small budget fun\\n", "imdb_user_review": "Good little indie movie. Admittedly I didnt know the budget was so tiny until looking at some other reviews. Story is something a bit different if unfortunately not able to be fully realised. Acting from all on board was solid, script was surprisingly entertaining and direction / score etc largely worked well. Worth a look in to see what can be done with small backing or even just for a bit of fun, though dont approach with expectations of blockbuster effects as it would be foolish.", "imdb_user_review_date": "19 December 2020", "imdb_user_rating": 9, "imdb_n_helpful_vote": 0, "imdb_t_vote": 0, "url": "https://www.imdb.com/title/tt9916190/reviews", "spider": "imdb_user_review", "date": "20/08/2021"}
{"imdb_tconst": "tt9916190", "imdb_user": "joebleech", "imdb_user_review_topic": "9 out of 10 for a film of this kind\\n", "imdb_user_review": "I'm scoring this based on my personal opinion, and classed it as a low budget. I'm not comparing it to any other type of movie to give an accurate reflection. I watched it because it was fun. Do I regret it... no. Will it win Oscars also no. This is down to earth fun, solid acting and solid plot. They've seemed to make the best with what they had and the end result is a high end low budget movie. I would recommend for sure but don't pull it apart and try to make it something its not... just sit back and appreciate the ride.", "imdb_user_review_date": "19 December 2020", "imdb_user_rating": 9, "imdb_n_helpful_vote": 0, "imdb_t_vote": 0, "url": "https://www.imdb.com/title/tt9916190/reviews", "spider": "imdb_user_review", "date": "20/08/2021"}
